Z||000000||Gold-86SE||08-24-2000||05:58 PM||||<BR>We have spent many hours discussing the Pace Car itself, but my curiousity lies with the SD engine.<P>Was there ever any publicity shots taken of the engine used in the Pace for the 84 Indy Fiero?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gold-86SE (Fiero Collector)||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||08-25-2000||02:58 AM||||Yes they are in the "Pontiac Performance Plus" SD4 magazine. This shows everything about how to build the SD4 and the Fiero race car. Up to and including all the mods done to the official Indy Pace Car. <BR>I have the magazine, which was published by  Hot Rod magazine for Pontiac and sold thru dealerships in 1985. It is basically a step-by-step procedure on builing the SD4 and the race car.||||reg||1
