Z||000015||Oreif||08-27-2000||07:21 AM||||There were 2 forms of the magazine put out. The first (which is what I have) has a Fiero drag race car on the cover. The magazine has all the SD4 stuff inside. It also has an article where they put an SD4 into a firebird and got 13.2secs in the 1/4 mile.<BR>The second magazine had just the SD4 engine info and the race car chassis stuff. It has a red cover with yellow letters saying "Super Duty Engine and race car Handbook" (not exactly sure of exact wording)||||reg||1
